 at VR Awards **\n** Winner of 'Best Small Studio' at the TIGA Awards **\n\nThe award-winning Zombieland: Headshot Fever is an arcade light-gun game built for VR.\n\nThis zombie-killing race sport brings light-gun games into the 21st century! Headshot combos slow the clock, meaning the most precise shooter is the fastest - challenge the leaderboards with skill, speed, and accuracy.\n\nFEATURES:\n{958104066384162}\nBullet Time - Two headshots turn the world slow!\n{1132267338685310}\nLeaderboards - Challenge the world!\n{1038303291795263}\nWeapons - Unlock and upgrade a range of weapons!\n{609884205110187}\nThe Zombieland Invitational - The zombie-killing race course of your nightmares!\n{1794959568031203}\nArcade Mode - a new roguelite experience!\n\nAccolades:\n- \"Insanely addictive\" - VRFocus\n- \u201cThe gameplay is incredibly fun and really addictive\u201d - BMF VR\n- \"Arcade head blasting fun\" - Beardo Benjo\n- \u201cThe headshot slowmo is seriously addictive\u201d - Cerberusarms\n- \"A joy to play\u201d - Platinum Award, Thumb Culture", "short_description": "** VR Game of the Year finalist - VR Awards **\n** VR Game of the Year finalist - TIGA Awards **\n\n\"Insanely addictive\" - VRFocus\n\u201cThe gameplay is incredibly fun and really addictive\u201d - BMF VR\n\"Arcade head blasting fun\" - Beardo Benjo\n\nThe award-winning Zombieland: Headshot Fever is an arcade light gun game built for VR.\n\nHeadshot combos slow the clock, meaning the most precise shooter is the fastest - challenge the leaderboards with skill, speed, and accuracy."}]}, "developer_name": "XR Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xrgames.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XR Games / Sony Pictures Virtual Reality (SPVR)", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.zombielandvrgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", 